          The proposed loan of up to EUR 9 million to Polykrome SA (the Company) is to support the Companys investment program, and includes:  
         (i) relocating Polykromes existing  
         production facility to a new industrial site; (ii) purchasing additional machinery to expand its product offering; and (iii) working capital requirements (the Project).

